import ../../helpers/driver.dl
import lib/text_scan.dl

appearance page appearance:
    padding is 16
    gap is 12
    background is UI ink 20 25 35
    text is UI ink 225 230 240
    font size is 18

document choices using page appearance:
    choice field "Palette" choosing "First":
        choice "First"
        choice "Disabled"
        choice "Third"
        choice "Fourth"
        choice "Fifth"
        choice "Sixth"
        choice "Seventh"
        choice "Eighth"
        choice "Ninth"
        choice "Tenth"
        choice "Eleventh"
        choice "Last"
    button "After"

set instance to an instance of choices
set view to a UI view of (the address of instance) sized 300 by 260 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set field to the UI layout labeled "Palette" in (view's layout)
set unavailable to the UI child at 1 in (field's node)
set UI control unavailable enabled false in (the address of instance)
activate UI layout field in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set popup to the address of (view's popup choices)
require condition ((0 < popup's rows <= 8) and (popup's rows < popup's count)) reporting "A dropdown did not bound its visible rows."
require condition ((popup's bounds' x >= 8.0) and ((popup's bounds' x + popup's bounds' width) <= 292.0)) reporting "A dropdown exceeded its viewport width."
require condition ((popup's bounds' y >= 8.0) and ((popup's bounds' y + popup's bounds' height) <= 252.0)) reporting "A dropdown exceeded its viewport height."
require condition ((the UI popup font in (the address of view))'s size = 18) reporting "A dropdown discarded its control's font."
set appearance to the UI popup appearance in (the address of view)
require condition ((appearance's background's red = 20) and (appearance's foreground's red = 225)) reporting "A dropdown discarded its authored colors."
set anchor to field's painted bounds
set view's height to 600
set field's painted bounds to UI box at 16 330 sized 268 50
refresh UI popup choices in (the address of view)
require condition ((popup's bounds' y + popup's bounds' height) <= 326.0) reporting "An upward dropdown overlaps its tall anchor."
set view's height to 260
set field's painted bounds to anchor
refresh UI popup choices in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 264 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 269 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((popup's selected = 11) and (popup's first > 0)) reporting "End did not reveal the last dropdown option."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 268 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 264 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 257 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (((the UI value for (field's node) in (the address of instance))'s text = "Third") and (view's popup = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI layout))) reporting "Dropdown keyboard input did not skip disabled choices and accept exactly once."
activate UI layout field in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set x to popup's bounds' x + 20.0
set y to (popup's bounds' y + 6.0) + (popup's row height / 2.0)
queue UI input of kind 1 key 0 at x y with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 1 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's popup = field) reporting "A dropdown accepted on pointer press instead of release."
queue UI input of kind 2 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the UI value for (field's node) in (the address of instance))'s text = "First") reporting "A dropdown did not accept its released option."
activate UI layout field in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set y to ((popup's bounds' y + 6.0) + (2.0 * popup's row height)) + (popup's row height / 2.0)
queue UI input of kind 1 key 0 at x y with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 1 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 1 key 0 at 299.0 259.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((view's popup = field) and ((the UI value for (field's node) in (the address of instance))'s text = "First")) reporting "Dragging out of a dropdown committed its pressed option."
queue UI input of kind 2 key 1 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's popup = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI layout)) reporting "An outside press did not dismiss a dropdown."
activate UI layout field in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 7 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's popup = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI layout)) reporting "A dropdown retained capture after focus loss."
activate UI layout field in (the address of view)
set UI control (field's node) enabled false in (the address of instance)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 257 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((view's popup = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI layout)) and ((the UI value for (field's node) in (the address of instance))'s text = "First")) reporting "A disabled dropdown owner accepted an option."
set UI control (field's node) enabled true in (the address of instance)
activate UI layout field in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set view's width and view's height to 20
queue UI input of kind 3 key 269 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 257 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the UI value for (field's node) in (the address of instance))'s text = "First") reporting "A dropdown accepted an invisible choice."
require condition (popup's rows = 0) reporting "A dropdown retained rows in an unusable viewport."
close the address of view
close the address of instance
print line "Dropdowns reuse bounded choices, authored presentation, disabled navigation, pointer release and hidden-list protection."
